WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
How do I tell my age as a slime?

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,600
Isn’t this a scam? What should I do?

3
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:06,000
Should I give up my seat or not?

4
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:09,820
There's no need to take the risk. It's best to give up your seat.

5
00:00:09,820 --> 00:00:11,820
If you don't want to break the rules, give up your seat.

6
00:00:12,920 --> 00:00:20,650
Do you think Zhuang Tax will not violate the rules?

7
00:00:23,390 --> 00:00:25,390
Give up your seat for something?

8
00:00:25,390 --> 00:00:27,390
Do you want to listen to what you are saying?

9
00:00:27,390 --> 00:00:29,390
How could a young man become blind at such a young age?

10
00:00:29,390 --> 00:00:30,590
Those are not seats

11
00:00:30,590 --> 00:00:33,610
It's all his fault

12
00:00:33,610 --> 00:00:36,180
It's all his fault for causing me to suffer

13
00:00:36,180 --> 00:00:38,460
where are you going

14
00:00:38,460 --> 00:00:40,060
are you going on a trip

15
00:00:40,060 --> 00:00:42,860
I know a beautiful place to travel to

16
00:00:43,460 --> 00:00:45,460
Can you get off the car with me in a moment?

17
00:00:45,460 --> 00:00:47,820
Not answering is a bad default.

18
00:00:47,820 --> 00:00:50,820
I'll take you to a nice place.

19
00:00:50,820 --> 00:00:55,290
Can I change seats with you?

20
00:00:55,290 --> 00:00:58,420
Then why don't you open the car window?

21
00:00:58,420 --> 00:00:59,420
And you're noisy

22
00:00:59,420 --> 00:01:00,420
You talk again

23
00:01:00,420 --> 00:01:01,420
wait until the station

24
00:01:01,420 --> 00:01:03,420
I'll cut your tongue
